Blast's convex hull helper transposes Vec3V values with V4Transpose and
stores them as Vec4V. On SSE both are __m128 so it compiles; on ARM NEON
they are different types and it doesn't. Load as Vec4V instead (only the
three transposed xyz rows are kept, so the w lane doesn't matter).

diff --git a/blast/source/sdk/extensions/authoring/NvBlastExtApexSharedParts.cpp b/blast/source/sdk/extensions/authoring/NvBlastExtApexSharedParts.cpp
